<title>USA: ADE Corp Q3 Jan 31 profit rises.</title>
<headline>ADE Corp Q3 Jan 31 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>WESTWOOD, Mass. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts, unaudited)</p>
<p>				Three Months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>					   1997    1996    1997    1996</p>
<p> Revenues			   $23,775 $17,715 $64,749 $46,585</p>
<p>Equity in net earnings of</p>
<p>  affiliated companies		156     ---     171     ---</p>
<p> Net income			   3,061   2,224   8,448   5,226</p>
<p> Net income per share		0.38    0.28    1.05    0.75</p>
<p> Avg shares			   8,050   8,063   8,015   6,947</p>
<p>NOTE: Ending backlog on January 31, 1997 was $60.6 million versus $58.4 million on October 31, 1996.</p>
